# wear/woman/coat_hang: the coat's skirt from the waist to the knee, open at the front (her trousers show between the fronts),
# the lit hem band (the edge region) and its outline row; the back skirt kicks out on the stride and flies in the run
# GARB-W (P2b wave 2). Fitted to one body (STYLE_P2 22). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# The motion rebuild (2026-10-21, docs/MOTION_P2.md 7.3): in side walk and run frames both knees and two shin rows show
# under the skirt. `wide` (contact, down) lifts the lit hem to F-7 with the back skirt a row longer behind the legs; the
# `flare` (run) flies the back panel out from the waist and sweeps the front over the leading thigh, clear of the kicked
# shin and the flight's high knee; the side `rest` views stop above the knee rows, which <garment>_stride.pxm puts back for
# every standing leg key (pixel for pixel) and lifts in the pass keys.
use person woman
body woman
role garment coat
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
sway 3

